{"id":"fce1d3d3cc84fab5","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-thm-measurable-cardinal.md","title":"Measurable Cardinal","display":"thm-measurable-cardinal — Measurable Cardinal","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-measurable-cardinal","aliases":["58-thm-measurable-cardinal"],"display":"thm-measurable-cardinal — Measurable Cardinal","depends_on":["[[../batch06/58-df-measurable-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-measurable-cardinal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-measurable-cardinal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-measurable-cardinal — Measurable Cardinal"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b4fb7c1808c84d14\" href=\"?note=b4fb7c1808c84d14\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-measurable-cardinal.md\">../batch06/58-df-measurable-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" href=\"?note=5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md\">../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> (cardinal)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span> (cardinal predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> (ultrafilter)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Measurable}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Measurable}_S\\)</span> (measurable-cardinal predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S\\)</span> (ultrafilter predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KappaCompleteFilter}_S(U,\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathrm{KappaCompleteFilter}_S(U,\\kappa)\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>-completeness predicate defined below)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}kappa\\text{-}complete\\text{-}filter}\\vdash\\mathrm{KappaCompleteFilter}_S(U,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow U\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\kappa)\\land\\forall\\mathcal A\\subseteq U\\;\\Bigl(|\\mathcal A|&lt;\\kappa\\to\\{x\\in\\kappa\\mid\\forall A\\in\\mathcal A\\;(x\\in A)\\}\\in U\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}kappa\\text{-}complete\\text{-}filter}\\vdash\\mathrm{KappaCompleteFilter}_S(U,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow U\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\kappa)\\land\\forall\\mathcal A\\subseteq U\\;\\Bigl(|\\mathcal A|&lt;\\kappa\\to\\{x\\in\\kappa\\mid\\forall A\\in\\mathcal A\\;(x\\in A)\\}\\in U\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}measurable\\text{-}cardinal}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(\\kappa)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega&lt;\\kappa\n\\land\\exists U\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\kappa)\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,\\kappa)\n\\land\\mathrm{KappaCompleteFilter}_S(U,\\kappa)\n\\land\\forall\\alpha&lt;\\kappa\\;(\\{\\alpha\\}\\notin U)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}measurable\\text{-}cardinal}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(\\kappa)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega&lt;\\kappa\n\\land\\exists U\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\kappa)\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,\\kappa)\n\\land\\mathrm{KappaCompleteFilter}_S(U,\\kappa)\n\\land\\forall\\alpha&lt;\\kappa\\;(\\{\\alpha\\}\\notin U)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Thus measurability is characterized by a nonprincipal <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>-complete ultrafilter on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch06/58-df-measurable-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"b4fb7c1808c84d14","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-measurable-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md","status":"resolved","id":"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Measurable}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{KappaCompleteFilter}_S(U,\\kappa)","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}kappa\\text{-}complete\\text{-}filter}\\vdash\\mathrm{KappaCompleteFilter}_S(U,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow U\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\kappa)\\land\\forall\\mathcal A\\subseteq U\\;\\Bigl(|\\mathcal A|<\\kappa\\to\\{x\\in\\kappa\\mid\\forall A\\in\\mathcal A\\;(x\\in A)\\}\\in U\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}measurable\\text{-}cardinal}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(\\kappa)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega<\\kappa\n\\land\\exists U\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\kappa)\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,\\kappa)\n\\land\\mathrm{KappaCompleteFilter}_S(U,\\kappa)\n\\land\\forall\\alpha<\\kappa\\;(\\{\\alpha\\}\\notin U)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false}],"bytes":1470,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4304","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-thm-measurable-cardinal.md|58-thm-measurable-cardinal]]（batch07）"}],"outgoing":["b4fb7c1808c84d14","5e8b8d97b21dd8e8","5fb1c2241d1943d1"]}